---
---
<section class="about section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header animate-on-scroll">
      <span class="section-label">About Me</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Engineering at Scale</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        From high-throughput backends to AI-powered products — building software that performs
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-image animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="image-wrapper">
          <div class="image-placeholder">
            <svg width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="image-border-glow"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-floating-card card-1">
          <span class="floating-emoji">⚡</span>
          <span>~140 req/s</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about-floating-card card-2">
          <span class="floating-emoji">🏗️</span>
          <span>SaaS Architect</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-content animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="about-text">
          <p>
            I'm a senior software developer with 6+ years of experience specializing in
            scalable backend systems, SaaS architecture, API development, and modern web
            applications. I work across the full stack — from crafting production-grade
            APIs with PHP/Symfony, Node.js, and Go, to building dynamic frontends with
            React, TypeScript, and Next.js.
          </p>
          <p>
            My work includes designing multi-tenant SaaS platforms with tenant isolation,
            RBAC, and secure API architectures. I've built high-throughput systems, including
            a GPS tracking backend handling approximately 140 requests per second. I'm also
            experienced with asynchronous architectures using RabbitMQ, Redis, and SQS.
          </p>
          <p>
            More recently, I've been building AI-powered functionality using LLM APIs,
            LangChain, LangGraph, and agent frameworks — integrating intelligent capabilities
            into production applications. I'm passionate about clean architecture, performance
            optimization, and shipping software that works reliably at scale.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-highlights">
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <div class="highlight-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                <rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="6.01" y2="6"/>
                <line x1="6" y1="18" x2="6.01" y2="18"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4>Scalable Backends</h4>
              <p>High-throughput APIs & microservices</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <div class="highlight-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4>Security-First</h4>
              <p>RBAC, tenant isolation, secure auth</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <div class="highlight-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4>Performance</h4>
              <p>Optimized for production-grade loads</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: var(--space-4xl);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-image {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .image-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 320px;
    height: 380px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .image-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--gradient-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .image-border-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -2px;
    border-radius: calc(var(--radius-xl) + 2px);
    background: var(--gradient-primary);
    z-index: -1;
    opacity: 0.5;
    filter: blur(8px);
    animation: pulse-glow 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .about-floating-card {
    position: absolute;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .card-1 {
    top: 10%;
    right: -10%;
    animation-delay: 0s;
  }

  .card-2 {
    bottom: 15%;
    left: -10%;
    animation-delay: -3s;
  }

  .floating-emoji {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .about-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .about-text p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-highlights {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .highlight-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    background: var(--bg-glass);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
  }

  .highlight-item:hover {
    background: var(--bg-glass-strong);
    border-color: var(--border-accent);
    transform: translateX(8px);
  }

  .highlight-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(108, 99, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .highlight-item h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .highlight-item p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-3xl);
    }

    .image-wrapper {
      width: 260px;
      height: 320px;
    }

    .about-floating-card {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
